# __FEATHER_APP_NAME__

Built with [Feather](https://docs.featherframework.org).

## Development

```bash
source venv/bin/activate
feather dev
```

Then open http://localhost:5173. `feather test` runs the test suite.

## Deploy

Deploy anywhere that runs a container with the generated `Dockerfile`. See
[Deploying with Docker](https://docs.featherframework.org/deployment/docker).

Or deploy on Appentic, which sets up the database, Redis and background worker
for you. See
[Deploying to Appentic](https://docs.featherframework.org/deployment/appentic).
